Cell["\<\
The internal projector is applied to each site-diagonal Green block, and the \
contributions are summed over device sites.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->311722151,ExpressionUUID->"25cc16ec-18d4-284c-8de6-100fc0817f75"],

Cell["\<\
The shortest form uses the lead onsite block as the device Hamiltonian.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1181619828,ExpressionUUID->"cf783fec-c885-184a-b6c3-a79cf4691ced"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The default ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["mode", "TI",
